%[text] # Replication of Polyphase FRFT Implementation
%[text] In \[1\], a polyphase FRFT implementation is proposed for implementation on FPGA. Here we'll be replicating it in matlab.  
%[text] 
%[text] \[1\] R. Tao, G. Liang, and X.-H. Zhao, ‘An Efficient FPGA-based Implementation of Fractional Fourier Transform Algorithm’, *J  Sign Process Syst Sign Image Video Technol*, vol. 60, no. 1, pp. 47–58, Jul. 2010, doi: [10.1007/s11265-009-0401-0](https://doi.org/10.1007/s11265-009-0401-0). 
